@startuml
scale 1.6
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F9F5
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #ECFDF5
skinparam stateBorderColor #059669
skinparam stateFontColor #064E3B
skinparam arrowColor #047857

title Medical Agent 框架设计\n(ReAct 模式 + Planning 模式 → 双模式智能执行引擎)

state "用户查询" as Query
state "实体识别\nEntity Recognition" as EntityRec
state "安全预检查\nSafety Layer" as Safety
state "复杂度评估\nComplexity Assessment" as Complexity

state "PlanAndExecute 模式" as PlanMode {
  state "模板匹配\nTemplate Matching" as TemplateMatch
  state "构建 DAG\nBuild Task DAG" as BuildDAG
  state "并行执行\nParallel Execute" as ParallelExec
  state "结果聚合\nResult Aggregation" as Aggregate
  state "重规划?\nReplan?" as Replan
  state "回退到ReAct\nFallback to ReAct" as Fallback
}

state "ReAct 循环\nReAct Loop" as ReActLoop {
  state "Think\n推理分析" as Think
  state "Act\n执行动作" as Act
  state "Observe\n观察结果" as Observe
  state "Decide\n规则化决策" as Decide
  state "满足?" as Satisfied
}

state "证据评估\nEvidence Evaluation" as EvidenceEval
state "三层综合回答\n3-Layer Answer" as Answer
state "质量检查\nQuality Check" as QualityCheck
state "WebSocket推送\n结果输出" as Output

[*] --> Query

Query --> EntityRec: 用户输入查询

EntityRec --> EntityRec: 词典匹配:\n• 疾病词典 (糖尿病, 高血压...)\n• 药物词典 (二甲双胍, 利拉鲁肽...)\n• 指标词典 (eGFR, HbA1c...)\n• 关系关键词 (禁忌, 对比, 相互作用...)

EntityRec --> Safety: 实体识别完成\n→ WebSocket: agent:entities

Safety --> Safety: **Layer 1 (最高优先级)**\nStep 1: 禁忌阈值匹配\n  drug × indicator × patientValue\n  vs contraindicationThresholds\n\nStep 2: 药物相互作用检测\n  drug × drug → interaction?\n\nStep 3: 严重程度判定\n  absolute > relative > interaction\n  > safe

Safety --> Query: 绝对禁忌!\n早终止 Early Termination
note right on link
  绝对禁忌场景:
  • eGFR<30 + 二甲双胍
  • 禁忌症直接命中
  → 跳过所有检索, 直接返回安全建议
  → 0 次 LLM 调用, <1秒响应
end note

Safety --> Complexity: 非绝对禁忌\n→ WebSocket: agent:complexity

Complexity --> Complexity: 判断复杂度:\n• **simple**: 单实体, 无对比\n• **moderate**: 2-3实体, 单意图\n• **complex**: 多实体/对比/综合\n• **structured**: 含年份/条件过滤

Complexity --> PlanMode: level ∈ {moderate, complex}\n且 enablePlanning=true
Complexity --> ReActLoop: level = simple\n或 enablePlanning=false

state "Planning 模式入口" as PlanEntry
Complexity --> PlanEntry
PlanEntry --> TemplateMatch

TemplateMatch --> TemplateMatch: 6个内置模板 (零LLM):\n1. 指南年份过滤 (3 tasks)\n2. 药物禁忌检查 (3 tasks)\n3. 药物对比 (5 tasks, 含并行)\n4. 指标药物查询 (5 tasks)\n5. 指标决策支持 (5 tasks)\n6. 疾病用药建议 (3 tasks)

TemplateMatch --> BuildDAG: 模板匹配成功

BuildDAG --> BuildDAG: 构建任务 DAG:\n• 定义任务节点 (retrieve/evaluate/generate)\n• 定义依赖关系\n• 标记并行组\n\n示例 (药物对比):\nparallel_retrieve {\n  retrieve_drugA\n  retrieve_drugB\n}\n→ compare_drugs\n→ generate_answer

BuildDAG --> ParallelExec: → WebSocket: agent:dag

ParallelExec --> ParallelExec: 并行执行独立任务\n每个任务内部可调用:\n• retrieve (EnhancedRetrievalPipeline)\n• evaluate (EvidenceEvaluator)\n• generate (LLM)

ParallelExec --> Aggregate: 所有任务完成

Aggregate --> Replan

Replan --> Replan: 检查重规划条件:\n• entityCoverage < 80%?\n• evidenceQuality < 0.3?\n• failedRatio > 20%?\n• criticalTaskFailed?

Replan --> BuildDAG: 需要重规划\n(最多 maxReplanRounds=2 次)
Replan --> Answer: 满足条件
Replan --> Fallback: 重规划次数耗尽

Fallback --> ReActLoop: 回退到 ReAct 模式

ReActLoop --> Think

Think --> Think: 规则化决策 (ruleBasedDecide=true)\n检查满足规则 (按优先级):\n1. retrievalCount ≥ minRetrievalCount(3)\n2. maxSimilarity > minSimilarityScore(0.7)\n3. entityCoverage ≥ minEntityCoverage(0.8)\n4. absoluteContraindication hit\n\n任一满足 → 标记 satisfied=true

Think --> Act: 需要继续检索

Act --> Act: 执行动作:\n• retrieve: 调用 EnhancedRetrievalPipeline\n• expand_query: 扩展查询词\n• need_more: 请求更多信息

Act --> Observe

Observe --> Observe: 记录本轮结果:\n• 检索结果数量 + 质量\n• 实体覆盖率变化\n• 证据质量变化

Observe --> Decide

Decide --> Decide: 检查 canContinue():\n• status != completed\n• status != failed\n• !maxIterationsReached\n• !satisfied\n• !error

Decide --> Think: NOT SATISFIED\n迭代数 < maxIterations(5)
Decide --> Satisfied: SATISFIED\n或 satisfied=true

Satisfied --> Answer
Satisfied --> ReActLoop: 边界情况, 继续

Think --> Satisfied: satisfied=true\n直接跳出 (早终止)

Answer --> Answer: **三层综合回答生成**:
Layer 1 (Safety): 安全评估结论
  绝对禁忌 → 直接采用安全建议

Layer 2 (Retrieval): 检索结果综合
  多来源交叉验证

Layer 3 (Evidence): 证据等级标注
  GRADE A/B/C/D

Answer --> EvidenceEval

EvidenceEval --> EvidenceEval: 5维度综合评估:\n• GRADE 等级 (40%)\n• 来源权威度 (20%)\n  - 国际 1.0 / 国家 0.8 / 地方 0.6\n• 时效性 (20%)\n  - weight = 1.0 - years×0.05 (≥0.5)\n• 一致性 (10%)\n  - 正向词/反向词冲突检测\n• 适用性 (10%)

EvidenceEval --> QualityCheck

QualityCheck --> QualityCheck: 质量自检:\n1. 结论是否明确准确?\n2. 证据是否充分?\n3. 来源是否可追溯?\n4. 是否有适当警告?

QualityCheck --> Output: VALID\n→ WebSocket: agent:complete

QualityCheck --> Answer: INVALID\n需要修正

Output --> Output: 提交异步评估任务 (Redis+Bull)\n8维RAG评估:\n• Faithfulness (20%)\n• Medical Accuracy (20%)\n• Safety Assessment (20%)\n• Context Relevance (10%)\n• Answer Relevance (10%)\n• Evidence Traceability (10%)\n• Completeness (5%)\n• Terminology Accuracy (5%)

Output --> [*]: 返回结构化回答

@enduml
